<h3>order= sorts in the SQL, sort= sorts what came back</h3>
<p>{select:albums order="price", rows=4, sort="title"}{$title} {$price}{property:notLast@albums}, {/property:notLast@albums}{/select:albums}</p>

<h3>first= and last= after the query</h3>
<p>{select:artists first=3}{$name}{property:notLast@artists}, {/property:notLast@artists}{/select:artists}</p>

<h3>The properties of the loop</h3>
<ul>
  {select:labels}
    <li>{property:current@labels/} of {property:count@labels/}: {$name}{pad:if first@labels} <span class="dim">(first)</span>{/pad:if}</li>
  {/select:labels}
</ul>
